":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T21:25:26-07:00","id":1544071,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> Thanks for fixing the divination questions. The answers are<br /> 1. No ( I assume. Depends on <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>)<br /> 2. Yes<br /> 3. Yes <br /> <br /> So is this like a Jerry McGuire situation? You've had it with your job and you are going to start your own law practice? Just trying to be clear on what the plan is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T23:24:03-07:00","id":1544080,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544070#post1544070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thanks for the help! Ironically, perhaps, given the events of the story, I think one of the players had a glitch. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Time magics Paradox in real life! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T07:18:19-07:00","id":1544100,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544068#post1544068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Okay, Helmut will steal away Amir on his magical unicorn/Harley Davidson. \ud83d\ude0e ( Think very hippie version of Hagrid from HP. )<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I convey to Helmut that I have no recollection of Caliburn, but if he is available and willing, I could use his help in picking a mage from the Airport, but I am going on my own car, I need it to bring the mage we are picking up.<br /> <br /> I ask Helmut to provide coverage if needed, since Helmut is Acanthus I can explain easily that I have used <i>Divination</i>, I dont expect issues but better safe than sorry.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544071#post1544071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> Thanks for fixing the divination questions. The answers are<br /> 1. No ( I assume. Depends on <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>)<br /> 2. Yes<br /> 3. Yes<br /> <br /> So is this like a Jerry McGuire situation? You've had it with your job and you are going to start your own law practice? Just trying to be clear on what the plan is.</div> </div> </div> </div>Amir does not like bullies, but yeah, he is a Mage in a quest for immortality, archmastery, power and the higher realms; minion work is beneath him.<br /> <br /> <br /> Inside my car, before travelling I cast as a Praxis using my magical tool (Lunargent Coin):<br /> <br /> <i>Exceptional Luck 1</i><i>:</i><br /> +1 Reach assigned to instant use, +2 Reach to affect spellcasting rolls, +1 Reach for increasing the boon result to 8-again<br /> <br /> Gnosis (3) + Fate (3) + High Speech (2) + Shadow Name (3) + Willpower (3) - 2 dice to increase duration to 2 turns = 12 dice (with 9-again)\u200b<br /> <br /> -Shadow Name I am AMIR, a prince among men, I am empowring myself.<br /> -Subject is myself.<br /> -Boon is 8-again on spellcasting rolls, lasts for 2 turns.<br /> -Spending 2 Mana to avoid overeaching<br /> <br /> <b>10</b>, 3, 2, 7, <b>9</b>, 7, 7, 1, 5, <b>8</b>, 2, 4, 1, 4 (Exceptional sucess)<br /> <br /> For the Exceptional Success, I recover the willpower point, and recover all Mana spent.<br /> <br /> Paradox: 4 (2 dice from each reach), -2 from Dedicated Magical tool, -2 from 2 mana spent = 1 chance die<br /> <br /> 6\u200b<br /> <br /> No Paradox<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Exceptional Luck 2</i><i>:</i><br /> +1 Reach assigned to instant use, +1 Reach to use Advanced Duration<br /> <br /> Gnosis (3) + Fate (3) + High Speech (2) + Shadow Name (3) - 2 dice to increase duration to 1 day = 9 dice (with 8-again)\u200b<br /> <br /> -Shadow Name I am AMIR, a prince among men, I am empowring myself.<br /> -Subject is myself.<br /> -Boon is beneficial Conditions, lasting a day.<br /> <br /> 4, 4, <b>9</b>, 2, 6, <b>10</b>, 4, 2, 5, <b>10</b>, 6, 7 (Exceptional sucess)<br /> <br /> For the Exceptional Success, I recover a Willpower point (currently -1 on my total), and pick the <i>Charmed </i>condition as a result.\u200b<br /> <br /> For the spell results, I get 3 potence, and pick the following conditions: <i>Informed, Inspired, Steadfast</i><br /> <br /> <br /> Paradox: 1 die from having already incured in paradox in this Scene, -2 from Dedicated Magical tool = 1 chance die<br /> <br /> 7<br /> <br /> No Paradox<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Amir calls people on his contact list, preparing to being fired (it might not even happen, but he is fed up here); and also uses his attainment to try and remember Caliburn and his cabal, after all he wants to aid Helmut for his help in the airport matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 10-17-2024, 10:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T14:09:34-07:00","id":1544139,"title":"","content":"Helmut and Amir are the buddy comedy we never knew we needed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T14:41:02-07:00","id":1544141,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> Amir has no dots in Resources or Status (Lawyer), and nothing on his equipment sheet about a car. &quot;I'll allow it. But watch yourself, McCoy...&quot; <br /> <br /> Do you want to spend one of your <b>Charmed</b> conditions? Otherwise you are most definitely fired.<br /> <br /> In character, what is the nature of your <b>inspiration</b>?<br /> I'll say i<b>nformed</b> is related to Helmut's mystery.<br /> <br /> Amir has not received any additional communication from the Hierarch's provost. You have no memory of any mage living in the area named Caliburn. But, similar to Helmut, it is not like you know every single mage in the city. Alunno is one of the most powerful mages in the area, so you have definitely heard of him. But he is a very &quot;Head in the Clouds&quot; type Mystagogue, and is not that involved in Awakened politics.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T14:50:17-07:00","id":1544142,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a><br /> <br /> You do not detect any spatial or temporal distortions inside the car. The driver has a mind and is awake (as in not asleep, I mean....you know what I mean.) <br /> <br /> Another passenger must have left the book in the car. Lucky!<br /> <br /> When you activate your mage sight, however, you do seem to notice a certain twinkle in the eye of the driver looking in the rear view mirror.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T16:00:39-07:00","id":1544146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544141#post1544141\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> Amir has no dots in Resources or Status (Lawyer), and nothing on his equipment sheet about a car. &quot;I'll allow it. But watch yourself, McCoy...&quot;<br /> <br /> Do you want to spend one of your <b>Charmed</b> conditions? Otherwise you are most definitely fired.<br /> <br /> In character, what is the nature of your <b>inspiration</b>?<br /> I'll say i<b>nformed</b> is related to Helmut's mystery.<br /> <br /> Amir has not received any additional communication from the Hierarch's provost. You have no memory of any mage living in the area named Caliburn. But, similar to Helmut, it is not like you know every single mage in the city. Alunno is one of the most powerful mages in the area, so you have definitely heard of him. But he is a very &quot;Head in the Clouds&quot; type Mystagogue, and is not that involved in Awakened politics.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I thought that regular transportation was cover as basic necesities too. My understanding from my time living in the USA was that you might be homeless, but almost everyone adult owns a car due to lack of public transport options AND reasonable rates/prices for vehicles there.<br /> <br /> <br /> Amir is confused, he gets there expecting that the Arrow guy knows where to take the mage, but since he doesnt even have a Lictor title or an official Consilum status, he lack understanding what his 'official' role will be in this situation.<br /> <br /> He is clearly deputised by the Provost, but Amir would like to be Lictor, so everything should be by the book.<br /> <br /> Let me know when we change Scenes please.<br /> <br /> Thanks.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 10-19-2024, 11:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T16:02:42-07:00","id":1544147,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> <br /> <br /> T<b>he Inspiration </b>would be to get a new position, not necessarily on the Sleeper world. Full-time Lictor is perfectly aligned to Amir goals.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T16:48:56-07:00","id":1544151,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TravisLegge</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544064#post1544064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b><span style=\"color:#c0392b\">Please refrain from double posting to circumvent spam tools. </span></b></div> </div> </div> </div>What can we do to avoid the spam flagging our posts when modifying? This is a OC thread, we modify a lot of things here...<br /> <br /> Another post of mine in this forum got also flagged. Can you help me?<br /> <br /> Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T16:56:24-07:00","id":1544155,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a><br /> My character is attempting to come off as mildly charming, would you like a roll?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28497,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","user":"Emerys","date":". 10-17-2024, 08:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T17:37:36-07:00","id":1544162,"title":"","content":"Gilad might have forgotten airplane mode is a thing, whoops. But its fine, the phone's spirit mote will probably figure it out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T17:45:02-07:00","id":1544163,"title":"","content":"Rachel Chu is a sleepwalker Paralegal and Amir's personal assistant. The goldfish is named Philly. <br /> <br /> Rachel is the Archdeacon's great granddaughter, and part of the Hypnopomic Circle. At first Amir was somewhat resentful of having to babysit some nepotistic sleepwalker. But so far she has proved to be a very loyal minion...um...I mean protege. <br /> <br /> Her great grandfather gave her a car when she graduated from college, and she drives Amir everywhere. <br /> <br /> They go to the airport to meet up with Galahad, Olorion, and Helmut.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T18:06:07-07:00","id":1544164,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> Wifi is turned off. You could cast Coax Spirts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T18:26:21-07:00","id":1544167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544164#post1544164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> Wifi is turned off. You could cast Coax Spirts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, that is the plan. Who would be reasonable to contact ? My first thought was Lucas, because Arrow logistics is his job.<br /> <br /> Gnosis (3) + Spirit (2) + Shadow Name (3) in the sense of the warrior issuing an order = 8 dice<br /> <br /> <b>10</b>, <b>9</b>, <b>9</b>, 7, 7, 3, 2, 1, 4 = 3 successes.<br /> <br /> Gilad will send the message &quot;Trish and Galahad vanished from the cloud ship, Galahad Veiled himself before it happened. I am still in the cloud ship, the Peripheral Sight hasn't triggered, no spirits or ghosts seen and a storm is raging. Working on digging up this dog&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strateg