orum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-18T19:39:38-07:00","id":1544251,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> <br /> <br /> Are we there yet? More importantly, has the Scene changed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-18T19:51:58-07:00","id":1544252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544251#post1544251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a><br /> <br /> Are we there yet? More importantly, has the Scene changed?</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> Was there any other investigation you wanted to do on the plane?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-18T23:38:18-07:00","id":1544260,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a><br /> <br /> Remember (its been awhile) that Olorion was supposed to be picking Galahad and his new Arrow companion up at the airport after a <i>successful </i>mission in South America.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-19T06:41:50-07:00","id":1544285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544252#post1544252\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> Was there any other investigation you wanted to do on the plane?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, does Gilad's luggage show any changes ? What emergency numbers does Trish's phone have ? <br /> <br /> When they hit the ground and disembark starts, he wants to see what happened to Galahad and Trish's luggage. Did someone else take their seat or are their items still there ?<br /> <br /> Right now he thinks Trish's phone remain because it was in his hands. If so, he needs to know how, was it because of something of target exclusion, a Veiled <i>Shield of Chronos</i> or something else?<br /> <br /> He will probably only drop the spell on leaving, just to stay vigilant.<br /> <br /> On a side note, I am pondering on the Aspiration changes. I like to keep one short term, one mid term and one long term. Probably will change one to prove my innocence, since its the first step to finding them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-19T13:23:31-07:00","id":1544308,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a><br /> <br /> IF Amir remembered Galahad mission, does it mean that Amir is actually acquanted with the man? As in knowing his physical appearance? If so Amir wants to look for him.<br /> <br /> IF Amir does not know him, do he at least have his phone number?<br /> <br /> IF the answer to all previous questions is NO, Amir asks Helmut to cast Serendipity to try and meet the right people.<br /> <br /> Independently of any of those questions, Amir furiously writes in his phone trying to reach the Provost, asking for descriptions of the arriving people, flight number, gate, the place to take them, and of course trying to reach Galahad phone (if known).<br /> <br /> He does not want to cast, as he felt himself too close to Paradox. A bit cautious our man.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 10-19-2024, 08:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-20T20:02:38-07:00","id":1544371,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> <br /> <br /> I'm going to to say there is a -1 tilt &quot;Language Barrier&quot; to mental and social rolls till you can find a way to translate English. Magic is Challenge!<br /> <br /> Searching for luggage sounds like an investigation check. Navigating the airport would be survival.<br /> <br /> You would need to unlock Trish's phone, and again find some way to translate it to investigate phone numbers.<br /> <br /> Obviously the most direct magical approach to the mystery of the phone would be Time. But you are creative. And hopefully you will meet up with other mages that can help soon.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-20T20:08:58-07:00","id":1544373,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> <br /> <br /> Give me a politics check and an empathy check.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T04:22:24-07:00","id":1544382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544373#post1544373\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> Give me a politics check and an empathy check.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which attributes with those rolls?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T04:29:21-07:00","id":1544383,"title":"","content":"Int+politics<br /> <br /> Wits+empathy","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T04:59:35-07:00","id":1544386,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> Sorry. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> was right. Suffering from D&amp;D brain I guess. Wits+investigation and wits+survival.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T07:08:22-07:00","id":1544393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544383#post1544383\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Int+politics<br /> <br /> Wits+empathy</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 3 (Intelligence) + 3 (Politics) = 6 dice<br /> <br /> <b>9</b>, <b>10</b>, <b>9</b>, 1, <b>10</b>, <b>9</b>, <b>9</b>, <b>10</b>, 7 = 7 successes<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> 3 (Wits) + 2 (Empathy) = 5 dice<br /> <br /> 1, 2, 2, <b>9</b>, 3 = 1 success<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T07:31:41-07:00","id":1544395,"title":"","content":"Politics check 7 successes<br /> <br /> Wu Tao is the hierarch of the Concillium of San Francisco. He is probably around one hundred years old and came to power in the 70s amidst revialries between factions that mirrored sleeper gang wars of the period. He tends to prefer diplomatic and peaceful solutions to problems without duels, torture, and assassination.<br /> <br /> Colt, Wu Tao's provost, is allied with the Bay City Marshal faction of the Free Council, and as his shadow name implies tends to think that peace is made with an application of force. It may be that he is not that interested in seeing Gilad put on trial or taken in unharmed...or alive.<br /> <br /> The Talon Sentinal and the Interfector would probably like to see the Silver Ladder and the Libertines embarrassed by the incident in Argentina. Sending Galahad, the &quot;bookish&quot; Talon from Berkeley to help arrest Gilad, an apparently dangerous warrior, may be a reflection of those interests.<br /> <br /> Tai Sui, the Archdeacon, is an old friend of Wu Tao. Who knows how old? Anyways, he may be playing some other game entirely. But it is hard to know what the ancient Kingmaker is planning. The one thing you are sure of his that he is <i>very</i> fond of his great grand daughter.<br /> <br /> Take the informed condition for your exceptional success.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 10-21-2024, 10:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T07:54:42-07:00","id":1544396,"title":"","content":"Empathy 1 success.<br /> <br /> Rachael does not know her great grandfather (He is at least 90 years older than her). She grew up with her sleeper parents. She recently rose above quiessence, and you are the only mage she knows. Shee seems very eager to learn magic though.<br /> <br /> Her reaction to Amir's command seems to be a mixture of fear, disappointment, and a desire to prove herself to Amir.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T09:43:05-07:00","id":1544401,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a><br /> <br /> Amir casts as <i>Divination </i>with his attainments asking:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Will I identify this as a political plot?</li> <li>Will Rachel be in danger from this task?</li> <li>Will Helmut be in danger from this task?</li> </ol><br /> Amir has already asked his success chances, but he is becoming more paranoid remembering about the poltiical situation. He does not want to endanger Helmut nor Rachel whom should be innocent of the potential political fallout.<br /> <br /> Then he also asks:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Will Galahad be in danger from this task?</li> <li>Will I find out Gilad innocence?</li> <li>Will I find out Gilad culpability?</li> </ol><br /> <br /> The last 2 questions seem redundant, but this is <i>Divination</i>, so it could be that I find conflicdting information, incomplete, or fake. One NO and one YES for those 2, would confirm or deny something... But both in YES or both in NO would open more questions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 10-21-2024, 01:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T10:29:17-07:00","id":1544407,"title":"","content":"Reaction to original post<br /> <img title=\"17295313692268195670944745563256.gif\" data-tempid=\"temp_1705_1729531419966_376\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1705\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1705\" data-thumb-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1705&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"17295313692268195670944745563256.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-need-data-att-update js-lightbox-participant\" itemprop=\"image\"/> Thank you for editing <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T10:32:03-07:00","id":1544408,"title":"","content":"First casting<br /> 1. Yes<br /> 2. No<br /> 3. No<br /> <br /> Second casting<br /> 1. No<br /> 2. Yes<br /> 3. No<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T11:33:04-07:00","id":1544412,"title":"","content":"<b>Helmut</b>'s airport casting:<br /> <br /> <b>Serendipity </b>( from <b>People of Hour</b> Attainment ) - on '<i>finding another awakened afiliated with the Consilium here, beside me and Amir'</i> - if not working, then casting <b>Shifting the Odds</b> on same conditions.<br /> <br /> <b>Legacy Attainment</b> - Fate 2 =&gt; 2 auto successes<br /> <br /> If still needed to find target =&gt;<br /> <br /> <b>Shifting the Odds</b> -<br /> <br /> Gnosis 4 + Fate 2 = 6 dice<br /> <br /> <b>9</b>, <b>8, 8, </b>6, 6, 5 = 3 successes\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T11:39:10-07:00","id":1544414,"title":"","content":"Olorion is activating his first Legacy attainment<br /> <br /> \u201dFirst: Retained Reading<br /> <b>Prerequisites</b>: Initiation<br /> Bookworms are prolific readers, and none of them wants to let what they read slip away. This Attainment enables the Bookworm to perfectly recall any written or drawn information she has viewed, imitating the &quot;Perfect Recall&quot; spell for such purpose. Reach is assigned to instant use. \u201c<br /> <br /> He would like to try and recall he received any instructions to pick up Galahad that was in written, drawn, or text base formats","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T12:24:23-07:00","id":1544416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544412#post1544412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Helmut</b>'s airport casting:<br /> <br /> <b>Serendipity </b>( from <b>People of Hour</b> Attainment ) - on '<i>finding another awakened afiliated with the Consilium here, beside me and Amir'</i> - if not working, then casting <b>Shifting the Odds</b> on same conditions.<br /> <br /> <b>Legacy Attainment</b> - Fate 2 =&gt; 2 auto successes<br /> <br /> If still needed to find target =&gt;<br /> <br /> <b>Shifting the Odds</b> -<br /> <br /> Gnosis 4 + Fate 2 = 6 dice<br /> <br /> <b>9</b>, <b>8, 8, </b>6, 6, 5 = 3 successes</div> </div> </div> </div>Can you correct the IC text? I just fixed mine and it should have been <b>Shifting the Odds</b>, right.<br /> <br /> <br /> I will fix the IC text, and please fix yours there.<br /> <br /> Sorry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T12:26:19-07:00","id":1544417,"title":"","content":"No worries, I also check the CofD skills and attributes section for the same reason.<br /> <br /> Wits (2) + Investigation (-3) = chance dice<br /> <br /> <b>10 </b>= 1 success<br /> <br /> Here I was expecting Gilad to be confused searching for the stuff.<br /> <br /> Wits (2) + Survival (-1) = 1 dice<br /> <br /> 1 = 0 successes<br /> <br /> I do have an idea on facilitating English communication, although not in written form. The body speaks, so we just need to make it speak more clearly. The idea is that by using an Unveiling of Life and Spirit (to make the feel of what he is saying easier to parse), his body language can be made easier to read by [Life] on social rolls. Then a combined Unveiling would be used to make him able to more easily read the body language of others. Reach would be used for instant use, advanced duration and granting 9-again on those rolls. Would that be viable ?<br /> <br /> He will probably send a message to Galahad to arrange for safe passage to present the evidence he has.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T16:02:51-07:00","id":1544433,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544396#post1544396\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Empathy 1 success.<br /> <br /> Rachael does not know her great grandfather (He is at least 90 years older than her). She grew up with her sleeper parents. She recently rose above quiessence, and you are the only mage she knows. Shee seems very eager to learn magic though.<br /> <br /> Her reaction to Amir's command seems to be a mixture of fear, disappointment, and a desire to prove herself to Amir.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is she Sleepwalker due to the Hypnopompic Circle or due to other factors? I am asking what Amir suspects or know: was she a regular sleeper and now a high ranking Hypnopompic member, or she has no relation to the Circle?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T16:04:29-07:00","id":1544434,"title":"","content":"I think Life Unveiling could be used to communicate emotions and basic intentions - the way it does with domesticated animals or human infants. But it can not communicate language. That remains under the purview of the Arcanum of Mind.<br /> <br /> Gilad does not find anything different with his carry on luggage - unless he was given anything by Trish or Galahad. In that case, they would have disappeared (your choice). He does not find Trish or Galahad's overhead luggage or any other items belonging to them.<br /> <br /> I will award a beat for funny or emotional description of 8th Century Viking Man being confused by airports (The Terminal is one of my favorite movies!)<br /> <br /> He does, through the kindness of strangers, find his way to the luggage pick-up area. Again, he finds his own luggage, unchanged. But nothing belonging to Trish or Galahad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 10-21-2024, 07:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T16:21:47-07:00","id":1544436,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> From Rachael's perspective, she was just a normal yoga practicing, crystals and incense, &quot;Very Spiritual&quot; kind of girl from San Francisco until she met Amir and discovered that magic is real. Amir is aware that Silver Ladder families are more likely to produce Sleepwalkers and Mages.<br /> <br /> I wasn't going to bring up this plot point until latter, but since you asked about it. Amir and Rachael are aware that a few of the members of the cult have gone missing in the past few months. Might be worth investigating once the current crisis has passed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T16:34:50-07:00","id":1544438,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a><br /> Olorion recalls that Alunno reminded him to pick up Galahad, and he wrote down the flight number on a scrap of paper and put it in his pocket.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T16:49:55-07:00","id":1544440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544436#post1544436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> From Rachael's perspective, she was just a normal yoga practicing, crystals and incense, &quot;Very Spiritual&quot; kind of girl from San Francisco until she met Amir and discovered that magic is real. Amir is aware that Silver Ladder families are more likely to produce Sleepwalkers and Mages.<br /> <br /> I wasn't going to bring up this plot point until latter, but since you asked about it. Amir and Rachael are aware that a few of the members of the cult have gone missing in the past few months. Might be worth investigating once the current crisis has passed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fantastic, and thanks for letting me know.<br /> <br /> But my question was from Amir's perspective, is she one of the successes of his Mystery Cult? And now the leader of it? A couple of things to have in mind:<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>2ed Mage Core Book p 70</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Silver Ladder Caucuses make extensive use of <b>Cryptopolies </b>\u2014<br /> elaborate networks of <b>mystery cults that serve the dual purpose<br /> of propagating Silver Ladder ideals (and guiding Sleepers to<br /> Awaken) </b>and allowing th\u00e9archs to wield social influence against<br /> the Lie. <b>Th\u00e9archs do not control Cryptopolies directly, instead<br /> relying on Illuminated Retainers</b> \u2014 Sleepers, <b>Sleepwalkers</b>, or<br /> Proximi initiated into the Order.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Emphasis mine.<ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Does Amir believe (whether that is true or not in-game) that his Mystery Cult actually made Rachael a Sleepwalker? </b><br /> This is to explain the protectiveness he feels, I dont think he will be romantically involved with her, so this makes a better explanation of why he actually likes her so much.</li> <li><b>Is she managing the Hypnopompic Circle on his behalf?</b><br /> That would explain her subservience, as he is the power behind her. Because if she is great granddaddy favourite girl in the world, then hard to explain her being Amir's flunky without giving him potential influence with the Archdeacon for no reason. Unless he is expected to protect her, but that would have been explicit, and an Arrow would better equiped for that.</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 10-21-2024, 07:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T17:05:22-07:00","id":1544442,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> <br /> <br /> Olorion is going to activate Active Mage Sight: Mind and Space automatically<br /> I will spend a point of mana to activate Prime mage sight","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28497,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","user":"Emerys","date":". 10-21-2024, 08:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-22T09:22:36-07:00","id":1544466,"title":"","content":"With Prime sight Olorion ( and Galahad, who is an Obrimos) detect active Time and Fate spells coming from the big guy with the rainbow beard and the guy in a lawyer suit standing next to the small Chinese woman. Olorion detects no spatial anomalies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-22T10:00:19-07:00","id":1544471,"title":"","content":"Week 3<br /> <br /> Lots has happened! Great work fellas. Everyone take a beat for participation. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> takes an arcane beat for a dramatic failure, and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> takes an arcane beat for his obsession with temporal anomalies. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a> takes an beat for discovering an arcane secret and an arcane beat for discovering a new book through magical means.<br /> <br /> To Recap<ul><li>Gilad was in flight from Buenos Aires with the famous reporter Trish Takahashi and fellow Talon Galahad. Trish leaves her phone with Gilad, and then she and Galahad suddenly disappear without a trace from the plane.</li> <li>Olorion is sent by his mentor, Alunno, to pick Galahad and his companion from the airport.</li> <li>Helmut experiences some kind of anomaly in which the flower shop, owned by Trish's sister Nadashiko, disappears, and her husband, the Arrow Ronin Caliburn, seems to also disappear from his cell phone contacts.</li> <li>Gilad texts Lucas, his cabal leader, and learns that from Lucas' perspective, the mission he was sent on was a disaster, and the rest of his cabal, the band Utopia, were killed by enemies. Gilad remembers events differently. He remembers Trish saving them at the last moment when they were being attacked by scelesti and a large bird that scarred his face. Lucas has never heard of Trish, which is strange since she is a famous reporter who was assigned by her newspaper in San Francisco to write a news story about Utopia. She also helped Gilad to lead a ghost child to safety in Paris, which is something Lucas surely would have remembered.</li> <li>On the Uber ride to the airport, Olorion encounters a strange man who calls himself Blot, but he can't remember anything about the encounter. Perhaps exploring his own Oneiros will reveal the hidden memories.</li> <li>Amir receives a message from the Heirarchs Provost, Colt, that he needs to apprehend a dangerous traitor, Gilad, who is accused of betraying the Adamantine Arrow and his own cabal to the Seers.</li> <li>Amir yells at his boss and gets fired, along with his Sleepwalker assistant Rachel Chu.</li> <li>Amir and Rachel go to the airport, and meet up with Helmut, who has important information to share with Amir.</li> <li>Olorion also arrives at the airport, and meets Galahad, who has no memory of going to Buenos Aires, and was sent their to assist a mage named Amir.</li> <li>Gilad arrives in San Francisco, and after some confused bumbling around, locates his own luggage, but does not find any luggage belonging to Trish or Galahad.</li> </ul>Excited to see what happens next!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-22T10:47:12-07:00","id":1544474,"title":"","content":"I'm Time magics fan, and I already have headache on all those alternative plot lines in this story. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <img width=\"320\" height=\"180\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://media1.tenor.com/m/hW82kAp6weQAAAAC/timeywimey-dr.gif\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://media1.tenor.com/m/hW82kAp6weQAAAAC/timeywimey-dr.gif\" data-thumb-url=\"https://media1.tenor.com/m/hW82kAp6weQAAAAC/timeywimey-dr.gif\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-22T16:33:28-07:00","id":1544513,"title":"","content":"Olorion casts Telepathy between himself and the rainbow bearded man<br /> <br /> It is not a rote or praxes<br /> <br /> <br /> Gnosis 2 + Mind 2 +Willpower 3 = 7 base<br /> <br /> +1 reach for instant casting<br /> <br /> +1 reach for sensory range casting<br /> <br /> +1 reach: \u201conly thoughts the originating subject wishes to send are transmitted\u201d MtAw pg 161<br /> <br /> <br /> Potency: 3 (-0 dice)<br /> <br /> <br /> Yantras:<br /> <br /> Dedicated/Path Tool: +1 (-2 paradox die)<br /> <br /> <br /> Dice pool: 8<br /> <br /> <br /> Roll: 10, 10, 10, 7, 5, 4, 4, 1<br /> 10 Reroll: 8, 7, 4<br /> <br /> Total Success: 4<br /> <br /> Paradox: Chance Die (Dedicated Tool bonus)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28497,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","user":"Emerys","date":". 10-22-2024, 07:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T01:08:12-07:00","id":1544632,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> Sorry for the delay. Imagine your ST behind the ST screen making a deep thought frowny face and scribbling notes while the players munch pretzels and contemplate who will take the last slice of pizza.<br /> <br /> Rachel is a &quot;success story&quot; for the Hypnopompic Circle. Though she herself might not see it that way, since she did not fully awaken to magehood, and is a something of a stereotypical Asian American overachiever.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T02:17:47-07:00","id":1544635,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1543469#post1543469\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Michael excelled in school, ultimately earning a scholarship to a prestigious law school. There, he honed his skills in persuasion, argumentation, and legal research. It was during this time that he first attracted the the Silver Ladder.</div> </div> </div> </div>Clarifying question: Does this mean Michael was part of the Hypnopmpic Circle before he had his Awakening?<br /> <br /> Amir is 28. So he would have been in his 2nd year of law school when Rachel was a freshman in college.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 10-24-2024, 05:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T07:54:18-07:00","id":1544649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544635#post1544635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Clarifying question: Does this mean Michael was part of the Hypnopmpic Circle before he had his Awakening?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I was actually envisioning as a preexisting Meditation group, that Amir coopted and transformed into the Hypnopompic Circle.<br /> <br /> Given Amir's current understanding level (Gnosis 3), and goals it would make sense for him to actually help grow a cult, hence his Mystery Cult <i>Influence </i>not <i>Initiation </i>but since his skills do not lay that way he probably delegates on the most promising members.<br /> <br /> That could be why the Grand Father allows Rachel under his wing so to speak, as he saw a regular Sleeper become a Sleepwalker under this young mage influence. Just a thought that occured to me while typing this, you dont have to make the characters go this way.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544635#post1544635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Amir is 28. So he would have been in his 2nd year of law school when Rachel was a freshman in college.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Wait, what is Rachel's current age?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T13:17:00-07:00","id":1544675,"title":"","content":"Rachel is 22. She dropped out of law school and became a paralegal after her third breaking point (&quot;fitful slumber&quot;).<br /> <br /> Rachel has been a member of the Hypnopompic Cirlce since her first year in college at Stanford. One of the common initiations into the mystery cult is through a scientific sleep study conducted with undergraduates. Some students do it for the money, some because they hope it will boost their cognitive performance and help their grades.<br /> <br /> To answer your question, Rachel is loyal to you because you are the leader of the mystery cult that has slowly consumed her life over the past four years, and now that she is lucid she realizes that magic and the astral realm are real and you are her guide. She is obedient because, as you said, she has been trained/programed to be so (You have literally been inside her head). She was working at a prestigious law firm and making good money until about an hour ago, but now you are all she has.<br /> <br /> And a goldfish named Philly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T15:54:04-07:00","id":1544689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544675#post1544675\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rachel is 22. She dropped out of law school and became a paralegal after her third breaking point (&quot;fitful slumber&quot;).<br /> <br /> Rachel has been a member of the Hypnopompic Cirlce since her first year in college at Stanford. One of the common initiations into the mystery cult is through a scientific sleep study conducted with undergraduates. Some students do it for the money, some because they hope it will boost their cognitive performance and help their grades.<br /> <br /> To answer your question, Rachel is loyal to you because you are the leader of the mystery cult that has slowly consumed her life over the past four years, and now that she is lucid she realizes that magic and the astral realm are real and you are her guide. She is obedient because, as you said, she has been trained/programed to be so (You have literally been inside her head). She was working at a prestigious law firm and making good money until about an hour ago, but now you are all she has.<br /> <br /> And a goldfish named Philly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Amir is at Mind 2, so at most he has been in her (lucid) dreams, and done some telepathic communication. Truly impressive to a Sleepwalker.<br /> <br /> He will do something nice for her and for Philly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T16:57:55-07:00","id":1544691,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544689#post1544689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Amir is at Mind 2, so at most he has been in her (lucid) dreams, and done some telepathic communication. Truly impressive to a Sleepwalker.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wouldn't you do whatever a man that could read your mind, knew your secrets, was in your dreams, and spoke to you telepathically told you to do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T17:42:06-07:00","id":1544692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544691#post1544691\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wouldn't you do whatever a man that could read your mind, knew your secrets, was in your dreams, and spoke to you telepathically told you to do?</div> </div> </div> </div>No doubt, and the fact she is not in contact with her far, FAR more impressive great-grandfather skews the comparison in Amir's favour.<br /> <br /> I think Amir treats her halfway between a very successful project and a beloved pet. He is proud of her successes, would deal harshly with anyone trying to harm her, sincerly wishes her wellbeing, growth and safety; but it will never be a romantic relationship and he certainly does not see her as an equal.<br /> <br /> It sounds harsh but Amir it is very in the Ladder ethos. He truly believes Awakened are superior, not due to any fault of the Sleepers, but due to the Exarchs (cursed be their names), and that Awakened have a responsibility towards them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T07:47:48-07:00","id":1544726,"title":"","content":"I think it might be worth mentioning that Gilad has three dots in Shadow Name. Since he is currently just going through the arrival and immigration process, its possible it might apply the penalty for locating his mundane persona.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T09:08:46-07:00","id":1544730,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> <br /> <br /> FYI, Amir goals, in order of urgency:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Take <b>Gilad </b>into custody.</li> <li>Deliver <b>Gilad</b> safely.</li> <li>Inform the Archdeacon of the plot.</li> <li>Get assurances of <b>Gilad </b>innocence (as per his Divination) and survival.</li> <li>Guarantee <b>Rachel </b>and <b>Helmut </b>safety from the political fallout.</li> <li>Investigate the <b>Hypnopompic Circle</b> dissapearances.</li> <li>Pay <b>Helmut</b>'s help.</li> <li>Do something nice for <b>Rachel </b>and <b>Philly</b>.</li> <li>Get payback for being involved in a plot.</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T09:41:25-07:00","id":1544734,"title":"","content":"<b>Helmut</b> - Using his Combined Spell from Gnosis 4, he cast by one casting <i>Shifting the Odds</i> and <i>Exceptional Luck</i> - all cast to find <i>'mage called Gilad'</i>, based on descriptions from <b>Amir</b>. Potency spend to make 4 characters Targets of the spell - all 4 mages that meet in Airport Lounge.<br /> <br /> <b>Helmut</b> is pointing his blessing with his hippie Vape Pen like some wizard wand and murmurs something like song <i>'I put a spell on you'</i>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Casting both spells as Fate magic</b> -&gt;<br /> <br /> Gnosis 4 + Fate 2 + High Speech ( song ) 2 + Tool ( Vape ) 1 = 9 dices<br /> <br /> [<b>10</b>], <b>8</b>, 7, 6, 3, 3, 3, 1, <b>9 </b>= 3 successeses<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KWxDGQm2hKk\" data-code=\"KWxDGQm2hKk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/KWxDGQm2hKk/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-25-2024, 02:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T09:48:17-07:00","id":1544735,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544734#post1544734\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Helmut</b> - Using his Combined Spell from Gnosis 4, he cast by one casting <i>Shifting the Odds</i> and <i>Exceptional Luck</i> - all cast to find <i>'Galahad of the Adamantine Arrow'</i>, based on descriptions from <b>Amir</b>. Potency spend to make 4 characters Targets of the spell - all 4 mages that meet in Airport Lounge.<br /> <br /> <b>Helmut</b> is pointing his blessing with his hippie Vape Pen like some wizard wand and murmurs something like song <i>'I put a spell on you'</i>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Casting both spells as Fate magic</b> -&gt;<br /> <br /> Gnosis 4 + Fate 2 + High Speech ( song ) 2 + Tool ( Vape ) 1 = 9 dices<br /> <br /> [<b>10</b>], <b>8</b>, 7, 6, 3, 3, 3, 1, <b>9 </b>= 3 successeses<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KWxDGQm2hKk\" data-code=\"KWxDGQm2hKk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/KWxDGQm2hKk/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>You can not find a specific person with Shifting the Odds as far as I remember.<br /> <br /> High Speech as a song? You mean to use the song as a Yantra instead?<br /> <br /> Also, love the song!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 10-25-2024, 01:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T09:52:44-07:00","id":1544736,"title":"","content":"Galahad is right next to Helmut, I think you meant Gilad.<br /> <br /> I think <i>Divination</i> might be able to do it though, maybe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T11:03:14-07:00","id":1544739,"title":"","content":"Corrected the target named mage name. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544735#post1544735\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can not find a specific person with Shifting the Odds as far as I remember.</div> </div> </div> </div>I literally checked 2E corebook spells for that:<br /> <br /> <b>Shifting the Odds (Fate \u2022\u2022)</b><br /> <b>Practice: </b>Ruling<br /> <b>Primary</b> Factor: Duration<br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills: </b>Investigation, Politics, Subterfuge<br /> An Apprentice of Fate always has access to what she needs at the moment. <b>T</b><b>he mage focuses on locating a particular kind of person, place, or thing</b>, and this <u>spell directs her steps to it unerringly as soon as possible within the next 24 hours as long as the spell remains active.</u> Casting the spell looking for a kind of person in a crowd or an item anywhere it could appear is usually enough to immediately succeed.<br /> <br /> <b>The spell can find someone with a specific <u>Trait,</u></b> <b>occupation</b>,or context-specific quality <b>(e.g. \u201ccorrupt cop\u201d),</b> but it only locates the nearest or most available subject matching the description the mage provides, never a specific person or object (although destiny sometimes draws familiar faces together). (...)<br /> <br /> <b>+1 Reach: </b>The mage locates the desired object within one hour.( Could used the this Reach for quicker finding... )<br /> <br /> ( Trait being 'mage called Gilad' is proper formula. )<br /> <br /> <b>Exceptional Luck (Fate \u2022\u2022)</b><br /> <b>Practice: </b>Ruling<br /> <b>Primary Factor:</b> Potency<br /> <b>Withstand:</b> Composure<br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills:</b> Intimidation, Occult, Socialize<br /> The mage blesses the subject\u2019s endeavors or curses them with misfortune. Whether good or bad, the subject\u2019s luck is truly exceptional. This spell bestows a boon or inflicts a hex on the subject (see p. 134). The subject may Withstand a hex with Composure.<br /> <b>+2 Reach:</b> The boon or hex can affect spellcasting rolls.<br /> <b>+2 Reach: </b>Spend a point of Mana. The mage can cast this spell as a reflexive action.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544736#post1544736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think <i>Divination</i> might be able to do it though, maybe.</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Divination</i> will not help us, if we are not 'futureided' to find Gliad righ now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Divination (Time \u2022)</b><br /> <b>Practice: </b>Knowing<br /> <b>Primary Factor: </b>Potency<br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills: </b>Academics, Empathy, Investigation<br /> <b>The mage can look into her subject\u2019s most likely future.</b> Without Reach, the mage can only see generalities: \u201cWill I meet Anna again soon?\u201d is a valid question, while \u201cWhat time will the police arrive?\u201d is too specific to return an answer. This spell can see far into the future, such as telling the mage that a young cashier might eventually become a state Governor, or that a child prodigy might become a superstar, but looking too far from the present increases the likelihood of the answer being superseded by the point the future becomes the present. The Storyteller must decide what the future holds, taking into account the nature of the story as well as cues<br /> from the mage\u2019s questions. The caster can ask one general question per level of Potency, receiving answers of \u201cYes,\u201d \u201cNo,\u201d or \u201cIrrelevant.\u201d\u200b\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-25-2024, 02:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T11:28:35-07:00","id":1544740,"title":"","content":"You could ask if you will find Gilad in the baggage claim area. If that is a no, then use the second question to ask if you will find him in the immigration area. If both fail, you could use a third question to ask if you will find him in the airport, if that is also a no, maybe you walked into a slasher movie scenario.<br /> <br /> Another option is to use the Reach effect of <i>Divination, which </i>allows us to get more detailed responses, and ask where you will find Gilad.<br /> <br /> I think it might also be worthwhile to figure out who can cast the spells to get you there, since both those areas are restricted to arriving passengers and airport staff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 10-25-2024, 02:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T12:15:37-07:00","id":1544743,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> <br /> <br /> But the text is clear<i> &quot;it only locates the nearest or most available subject matching the description the mage provides, <b>never a specific person </b>or object&quot;</i>, emphasis mine. You are asking for <i>Gilad of the Adamantine Arrow</i>. that is a specific person.<br /> <br /> Just cast a different spell target, the same way I asked for a<i> &quot;Member of the Consilium&quot; </i>before.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T12:25:09-07:00","id":1544745,"title":"","content":"Which technically means that &quot;a temporally displaced viking&quot; also counts, should Helmut have received that information.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T14:02:03-07:00","id":1544749,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544745#post1544745\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which technically means that &quot;a temporally displaced viking&quot; also counts, should Helmut have received that information.</div> </div> </div> </div>If I can ask for <i>'temporally displaced viking'</i> - I can generally ask for <i>'mage called Gilad'.</i> \ud83d\ude09 It's much more probable I can get in nearby mage called the same name twice, that 'temporally displaced viking', on normal occasions. Time travelers are much rarer than people with the same name. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T15:06:16-07:00","id":1544753,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a><br /> <br /> While a person's name is technically a trait of that person, I think <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> 's interpretation of the rules for Shifting the Odds is correct. It is a Ruling spell and it ensures that an apprentice &quot;always has access to what she needs at the moment&quot;. Meaning &quot;I need a toothbrush&quot; not &quot;I need my favorite toothbrush that I left in Cincinnati, Ohio three months ago.&quot; It would require a more significant reweaving of the threads of Fate for your lost favorite toothbrush to appear then for any toothbrush to appear.<br /> <br /> Because when you are dealing with Fate magic you have to imagine the Rube Goldberg Machine like twists of luck that lead up to the desired outcome (Think of like the disaster scenes in the Final Destination movies). So it is more likely that someone dropped a toothbrush they just bought on the ground near you then for a cleaning lady at the hotel in Cincinnati throwing your favorite toothbrush away, but then a hole forms in the trash bag and the toothbrush falls out on the way to the dump and a stray dog finds it, and then a boy pets the dog and takes the toothbrush and it becomes his favorite toy for three months and he is going on a trip to visit his divorced dad in San Francisco, and his dad sees the toothbrush and says &quot;That is super gross. Why would your mother let you play with a dirty used toothbrush?&quot; and he takes the toothbrush away and the kid cries, which makes the dad even more mad and he throws it out the window of his very expensive apartment and it lands on the sidewalk as you are passing by.<br /> <br /> People often drop things they just bought at a store. So that would be ruling. It is less common for specific objects to travel to the other side of the country and appear right where you can find them. That would more likely be weaving, or patterning depending on how physically impossible the desired Fate outcome is. In this scenario, Gilad is more like your favorite toothbrush, and less like &quot;any random toothbrush. I really need to brush my teeth right now.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 10-25-2024, 06:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T15:26:29-07:00","id":1544755,"title":"","content":"Oops. Post got flagged. Long story short, no you cannot use Shifting the Odds to find &quot;A person named Gilad&quot;. You could do &quot;A Swede traveling from Buenos Aires&quot;, and hope that Gilad was the only one.<br /> <br /> Exceptional Luck is a little different. It helps you succeed at something you actively do, rather than passivly waiting for something to happen. It could give you a bonus to another roll, like wits+composure or wits+investigation.<br /> <br /> You could use Divination (this is probably what Galahad had in mind when he asked the two Acanthoi where they should go to look for Gilad).<br /> <br /> Or, and this might sound crazy, you could just go to one of the those places without casting magic at all, like a normal person. But where would the fun be in that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T15:34:45-07:00","id":1544756,"title":"","content":"The Shadow Name question is an interesting one. I feel like the rules for sympathetic connections and Fate are less clear then for Space. If they are exactly the same as Space, then yes there would be a penalty for a weak sympathetic connection.<br /> <br /> Gilad does have an assumed identity for his documents. Lucas would have provided for that before his trip began. I'll let <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> choose what the alias is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T15:45:25-07:00","id":1544757,"title":"","content":"Ahh. ST goof. It's been awhile since I flew in an international flight.<br /> <br /> International baggage claim is within the secure area. So there really is only one place to go - right outside of security check point. Unless you want to try to sneak into the secure area somehow.<br /> <br /> Maybe Helmut should cast exceptional luck on Gilad to make sure he gets out of the airport before Seers ( or god-machine) get him <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Ok. This might require another suvival roll for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>and some additional RP.<br /> <br /> Sorry for my mistake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T16:02:05-07:00","id":1544758,"title":"","content":"No worries. I think his cover name will be Sven \u00d6man, a Swedish consultant on Nordic and Finnish folklore. The name basically means &quot;that guy from the island&quot;, because no need to overcomplicate for what was supposed to be a fairly chill trip.<br /> <br /> Which attribute for the survival roll please ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T17:24:48-07:00","id":1544761,"title":"","content":"Wits. Or I suppose you could use manipulation if you wanted to &quot;rely on the kindness of strangers&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T18:21:39-07:00","id":1544762,"title":"","content":"Roger that, I think he will try to ask around and see if someone can point him in the right direction.<br /> <br /> Manipulation (3) + Persuasion (4) + Language barrier (-2) = 5 dice<br /> <br /> 1, 4, 5, 5, 4 = 0 successes<br /> <br /> I think I will go for a dramatic failure, what kind of condition does he get ?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avata