blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 10-26-2024, 11:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-26T12:47:12-07:00","id":1544809,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> <br /> <br /> Roll wits+composure to see if you notice anyone.<br /> <br /> And (dun, dun, dun) roll initiative if you wish to resist capture.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-26T12:50:09-07:00","id":1544810,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a><br /> <br /> Just to confirm. Helmut is attempting to go past the rope barriers and metal detectors and TSA workers into the secure area without using stealth in any way?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-26T13:37:37-07:00","id":1544812,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544810#post1544810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just to confirm. Helmut is attempting to go past the rope barriers and metal detectors and TSA workers into the secure area without using stealth in any way?</div> </div> </div> </div>Helmut was full on charge - but then when seeing all the barriers, TSA, etc. - he goes for stealth then. He incant theme song from Bond movie and turn on People of Hour 1st Attainment - <i><b>Fifty-Fifty</b></i>. It negates any penalties on Stealth rolls for him for this scene<br /> <br /> For anyone looking over Nimbus in area, it all goes a bit blurry and vertigo, with everyone becoming one with people around them and themselves. Everyone is bit ponded with 'Groovy' vibe, like after one beer. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Everyone thinks about 'groovy 60s' in their minds.<br /> <br /> Rolls and mechanics:<br /> <br /> Dexterity 1 + Stealth 1 + Willpower 3 = 5 dices<br /> <br /> <i><b>10</b>, 4, 2, 1, 1, 3 = <b>1</b> success</i><br /> <br /> He was humming the theme song under his nose<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iv_UStbLzpI\" data-code=\"iv_UStbLzpI\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/iv_UStbLzpI/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-26T16:33:24-07:00","id":1544817,"title":"","content":"Unless he is digging a deeper hole by resisting agents of the Consilium, he will resist. First the perception check:<br /> <br /> Wits (2) + Composure (2) = 4 dice<br /> <br /> <b>10</b>, 3, 2, 1, 3 = 1 success<br /> <br /> Initiative mod = 4 (base) + baton modifier (-1) = +3<br /> <br /> 7 = Initiative 10","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T11:11:29-07:00","id":1544895,"title":"","content":"Week 4<br /> <br /> Everyone take a beat for participation. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> take a beat for describing a luggage carousel in an amusing way and for generally being a good sport about things. I didn't notice any significant progress on any aspirations or obsessions this week, but if I missed something, please let me know.<br /> <br /> Brief Recap<ul><li>Amir, Rachel, Helmut, Olorion, and Galahad are all on the public side of the International terminal's arrival area.</li> <li>They briefly deliberated on the best way to find the mage they have been sent to find, Giilad, but then Helmut remembers that for International flights the baggage claim is on the other side of the security check point and is not open to the public.</li> <li>Helmut then decides to try to sneak past TSA security while humming the James Bond theme, in the hopes that his nimbus will sufficiently distract the security guards with guns and tazers and stuff from noticing him (After some basic internet searches, your beloved ST was surprised that there is not that much public information on what exactly would happen if someone tried to do this IRL, but my guess, given all the fears about terrorism and whatnot, is that it wouldn't be good.)</li> <li>Meanwhile, a few hundred feet away, on the other side of security, Gilad is briefly confused by the baggage carousel, and arouses the suspicion of people around him, including some as yet unidentified will-workers.</li> <li>These mages use some kind of Space and Prime magic to prevent Gilad from casting a Life spell, and identify him as the only supernal magic user in the group of sleepers he was hiding in, warding him from moving forward towards the airport exit.</li> <li>Gilad tries to find these mages in the crowd and readies himself for battle.</li> <li>We also learned some fun facts about one of our NPC, Rachel Chu*. Four years ago, when she was eighteen and a freshman in college, Amir's cryptopoly began messing with her head and giving her nightmarish dreams in an attempt to force her to awaken. After three psychologically traumatic breaking points and much <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DoPsjWqvwT4\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;Fitful Slumber&quot;</a>, she became a sleepwalker rather than a mage.</li> <li>Olorion and Galahad are very confused about what is going on right now.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> *I totally did not remember that that was the name of the main character in Crazy Rich Asians, the novel/movie until just now. I'm not sure what that says about me as a person. Send help <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T12:41:30-07:00","id":1544903,"title":"","content":"I am having a blast, I also find this whole situation very amusing. Gilad trying to be tactical about delivering the evidence, Amir being the consummate professional (while also considering his backup plan), Galahad and Olorion trying to figure out how they got tangled up in this mess, and Helmut boldly striding forth wherever the good vibes will take him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T13:12:36-07:00","id":1544912,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> <br /> <br /> Did you want your characters to do anything to help Helmut out before I roll to see if the five groovy security guards notice the huge rainbow bearded guy trying to sneak into the airport? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T13:14:38-07:00","id":1544913,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> It is your turn if you want to fight the two guardians. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T13:17:02-07:00","id":1544914,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544912#post1544912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> Did you want your characters to do anything to help Helmut out before I roll to see if the five groovy security guards notice the huge rainbow bearded guy trying to sneak into the airport? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>As per in the IC thread, Amir is just waiting to see what happens to cast<i> Shifting Sands </i>and undo lots of the effects, there is no need to hurry if everything is preordered (or you can make it look so).<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T14:27:35-07:00","id":1544925,"title":"","content":"Two of the guards, with a -2 penalty for feeling groovy [10, *7, 5] [9, 2] notice Helmut. They draw the attention of the other security.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T16:49:13-07:00","id":1544939,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> <br /> <br /> <b>Amir </b>asks <b>Olorin </b>if he skilled enough to make a telepathic neetwork, or failing that to communicate with <b>Helmut </b>that he might be putting sleepers in danger if <b>Gilad </b>gets spooked. We jsut need to know where he is, <b>Helmut </b>was asked, and he seemed to agree to find the guy, cant he just do that from here? As the next request was to stay with <b>Rachel </b>for their protection.<br /> <br /> <br /> Going against the flow on traffic in the international arrivals it a risk to the Sleepers, since police are trigger happy in the WoD. A Free Council member should at least consider that.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Amir </b>is not really concerned, worst he can imagine, a quick rewind can fix stuff, but information might be gained from letting things happen, he just dont want to risk the potential assessin (that the <i>Divination </i>says is innocent, but time shields are a thing) lashing a innocent people, like <b>Helmut </b>who is here only because he was asked as a favour.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T01:56:10-07:00","id":1544956,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a><br /> <br /> Give me a wits+composure to see if you see anyone in the far distance who might fit the description of a &quot;time displaced Viking&quot;. (I think of Gilad as looking like the actor Alexander Skarsgard. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> can correct me if this is wrong)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T01:57:31-07:00","id":1544957,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a><br /> Did you want to jump into the action in anyway?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T02:26:52-07:00","id":1544958,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544956#post1544956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Give me a wits+composure to see if you see anyone in the far distance who might fit the description of a &quot;time displaced Viking&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Helmut</b>'s Wits 3 +Composure =<b> 6 dices</b><br /> <br /> <b>9, 8,</b> 6, 4, 2, 1= <b>2 success</b> <br /> <br /> <b>Helmut</b> also prepare <i><b>Time Shield</b></i> in case Sleepers 'police' would be violent<br /> <br /> Gnosis 4 + Time 3 = <b>7 dices<br /> <br /> 10, 10, 9, 9, </b>5,5,3<b>, 8,</b> 3 = 5 successes on casting! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Can I make something cool on Time Shield with 5 successes? \ud83e\udd14 <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T05:20:12-07:00","id":1544963,"title":"","content":"What cool thing did you have in mind?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T05:44:35-07:00","id":1544964,"title":"","content":"Fun facts!<br /> <br /> Ward is a Space 2 spell, and Ban is a Space 3 spell. The reach effect was used with Prime 2.<br /> <br /> Something for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a> to keep in mind for the future with Olorion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T07:22:02-07:00","id":1544969,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a><br /> <br /> Since Amir has not been informed of Gilad lack of english knowledge, he will make a faux pas initially. But Olorin coud fix the language thing I assume.<br /> <br /> <br /> I plan to tell him a modified Miranda warning, considering that a Consilium is not the Sleeper government, can you offer advice?<br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Gilad?</i><br /> <br /> <i>In the name of the San Francisco Consilium you are being detained for questioning pertaining your last mission.</i><br /> <br /> <i>You have the right to remain silent. Anything you say can and will be used against you in a Consilium court. You have the right to talk to a lawyer for advice before we ask you any questions. You have the right to have a lawyer with you during questioning. If you cannot name a lawyer, one will be appointed for you before any questioning if you wish. If you decide to answer questions now without a lawyer present, you have the right to stop answering at any time.<br /> <br /> Do you understand each of these rights?<br /> <br /> Having these rights in mind, do you wish to talk to us now?</i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T07:23:50-07:00","id":1544971,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544963#post1544963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What cool thing did you have in mind?</div> </div> </div> </div>Taking in account that Time Shield change flow of the time around <b>Helmut</b> - and he is very closely related to Fae of Supernal Arcadia - maybe he saw a glimpse of Fae lurking over him in Mage Sight? Nothing truly groundbreaking, just small glimpse of Supernal beings watching(?) over him. It leads to <b><i>Inspired</i></b> Condition, feeling that Arcadia is favoring him.<br /> <br /> Can work like that?<br /> <br /> 'Time Armor speeds or slows time in the mage\u2019s area, allowing her to move out of the way of incoming attacks. Time Armor adds the character\u2019s Time rating to her Defense.<br /> Time Armor also allows the character to apply her Defense to Firearms attacks. In addition, if the character successfully Dodges an attack, the player can spend a point of Mana to reduce the attacker\u2019s Initiative rating by the mage\u2019s Time Arcanum dots for the remainder of the scene.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-29-2024, 10:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T08:05:49-07:00","id":1544977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544971#post1544971\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Taking in account that Time Shield change flow of the time around <b>Helmut</b> - and he is very closely related to Fae of Supernal Arcadia - maybe he saw a glimpse of Fae lurking over him in Mage Sight? Nothing truly groundbreaking, just small glimpse of Supernal beings watching(?) over him. It leads to <b><i>Inspired</i></b> Condition, feeling that Arcadia is favoring him.<br /> <br /> Can work like that?<br /> <br /> 'Time Armor speeds or slows time in the mage\u2019s area, allowing her to move out of the way of incoming attacks. Time Armor adds the character\u2019s Time rating to her Defense.<br /> Time Armor also allows the character to apply her Defense to Firearms attacks. In addition, if the character successfully Dodges an attack, the player can spend a point of Mana to reduce the attacker\u2019s Initiative rating by the mage\u2019s Time Arcanum dots for the remainder of the scene.'</div> </div> </div> </div>I think there might be a mixup of <i>Time Armor</i> with <i>Shield of Chronos</i>.<br /> <br /> <i>Time Armor</i> (core book page 194) is an Attainment that increases the mage's defense and requires no roll to activate (core book page 193).<br /> <br /> <i>Shield of Chronos</i> (core book page 188) is a spell that protects the user from being seen with temporal senses, such as <i>Divination </i>and <i>Postcognition</i>. Lastly, <i>Constant Presence</i> (core book page 187) is a spell that protects the subject from changes in the timeline.<br /> <br /> I think the one you intended to cast was <i>Shield of Chronos</i>, correct ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T08:25:15-07:00","id":1544981,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544958#post1544958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>Helmut</b> also prepare <i><b>Time Shield</b></i> in case Sleepers 'police' would be violent<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>. I was about to post, but you saved me the trouble. I assumed that what <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> meant was a Time Shielding spell (Veil of Moments, p.188), because he was preparing for combat with sleepers. Mage Armor is an attainment, and does not require casting, but does require spending mana. Always good to be precise. Please correct me if I was mistaken <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T08:48:51-07:00","id":1544982,"title":"","content":"I did run a lot of 1E Mage - like 10 years of it - got to run only few sessions of 2E, so my understanding of new spellcasting mechanics is wanky. In 1E Shields were normal spells.<br /> <br /> As Helmut 'cast' something - and was <i>exceptional</i> casting - it can be Veil of Moments there. If I can then, I spend extra Mana with the spell to activate Time Shield Attainment with it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T08:50:27-07:00","id":1544983,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> <br /> <br /> I've been being very strict with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> (and enjoying doing so) about his lack of the Language merit for English, so it would only be fair to do so with you three also. Currently, Gilad can speak Old Norse, and some modern Swedish. In the previous chronical he was relying on Lucas and Trish (who for reasons that are mysterious to Gilad, seemed to know nearly everyone's language) to do translation for him. Now he is alone <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> (one of many reasons for him to be sad and long for the past).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a> has a Condition because of the book he found in the Uber that allows him to use Old Norse for the duration of this chapter. Olorion also has Universal Language as a rote. h<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a><br /> <br /> I would be willing for you to use your exceptional success to say that the Fae temporally allowed you to speak to Gilad (I assume out loud and not with Telepathy). Do you want to go with that? Or play the very amusing &quot;Language Barrier&quot; game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T09:08:48-07:00","id":1544987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544969#post1544969\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a><br /> <br /> I plan to tell him a modified Miranda warning, considering that a Consilium is not the Sleeper government, can you offer advice?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543784-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e-chronicle-ic?p=1544688#post1544688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>&quot;Yes as this is a Consilium matter, but I would ask of all of you&quot;</i> says <b>Amir </b>looking each one in turn in the eye<i> &quot;to treat the suspect as innocent until given reason to do otherwise. He has a right to defense and counsel, and if you give the stink eye to someone who ends up being innocent you are souring the future harmony of the Consilium. </i><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Michael is a lawyer (currently unemployed) and so I think it makes sense that Amir would think of what to say to Gilad in terms of sleeper law.<br /> <br /> If I wasn't clear before, the reason the Hierarch sent Amir and not a Lictor, is that a Lictor is meant to be an impartial judge of the Lex Magica. The Hierarch wants you to be an Advocate of sorts for Gilad, and help defend him before the council. The Hierarch chose you because you are a Defense attorney and he thought you would be good at that sort of thing (Think of Matt Murdock defending Frank Castle)<br /> <br /> (I just started watching the new season of The Lincoln Lawyer. Looking forward to some Mage legal drama in the next chapter!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T09:23:09-07:00","id":1544990,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544983#post1544983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a><br /> <br /> I would be willing for you to use your exceptional success to say that the Fae temporally allowed you to speak to Gilad (I assume out loud and not with Telepathy). Do you want to go with that? Or play the very amusing &quot;Language Barrier&quot; game?</div> </div> </div> </div>I made declaration not seeing this post. BUT I also like this whole 'cultural misunderstanding' scene. BUT I also do no overlong it from others. <br /> <br /> <b>Maybe we can have this</b> - Helmut trys to speak in Old Norse and roll with Mind Scan spell. If ST agrees, I will hang on this 'Fae boon of language' in case the scene goes too far off the rails - suddenly the Fae translate Helumut's words, even if he doesn't know what he's saying until the end.<br /> <br /> For now we just go with my rolls...<br /> <br /> <b>Helmut</b> casts Mind Scan with 2 Reaches ( 1 for instant, 1 for understanding surface thoughts of Gilad ) =&gt; As Helmut have Mind 1, we are going into 1st Paradox roll in game. \ud83d\ude0e<br /> <br /> Mind Scan =&gt; Gnosis 4 + Mind 1 = 5 dices <br /> <br /> 10, 8, 8, 5, 5 , 3 =<b> 3 succeses<br /> <br /> Helmut </b>TRY to speak Old Norse <br /> <br /> Intelligence 2 + Academics 2 = 4 dices<br /> <br /> 4, 3, 2, 1 = <b>FAIL</b> \ud83d\ude1e<br /> <br /> P.S. For later character development - what Language would be easier to buy off Helmut? Old Norse ( ad he is immersed in Norse occult lore ) or modern Swedish? \ud83e\udd14<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T09:39:25-07:00","id":1544992,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a><br /> <br /> Are you wanting to contain the paradox or release it. Do you want to spend mana to mitigate chance of paradox?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T09:41:52-07:00","id":1544993,"title":"","content":"Spend Mana to mitigate -&gt; 2 points. If Paradox still occurs, I contain it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T09:44:35-07:00","id":1544994,"title":"","content":"[5] No paradox","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T10:27:26-07:00","id":1545001,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544987#post1544987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Michael is a lawyer (currently unemployed) and so I think it makes sense that Amir would think of what to say to Gilad in terms of sleeper law.<br /> <br /> If I wasn't clear before, the reason the Hierarch sent Amir and not a Lictor, is that a Lictor is meant to be an impartial judge of the Lex Magica. The Hierarch wants you to be an Advocate of sorts for Gilad, and help defend him before the council. The Hierarch chose you because you are a Defense attorney and he thought you would be good at that sort of thing (Think of Matt Murdock defending Frank Castle)<br /> <br /> (I just started watching the new season of The Lincoln Lawyer. Looking forward to some Mage legal drama in the next chapter!)</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, be aware that it would be weird in sleeper law that the ones that detain you are the ones that represent you. I think it would have been more aligned to this that you are suggesting, that a third party was sent to capture Gilad, and Amir is his suddenly appearing defense lawyer <i>&quot;My client does not need to answer that, I will join the proceeding, etc&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> This is what I plan to post in the IC thread:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Amir </b>signals <b>Olorin </b>and <b>Galahad </b>to approach as he gets closer to <b>Helmut</b>.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;<b>Helmut</b>, thanks for your help finding the man, what did he say to you?&quot;</i> <b>Amir </b>enquires<i> &quot;and please next time, don't run away without explaining, we were expecting you to tell us his location without moving, so <b>Olorin </b>could scry and contain if required&quot;<br /> <br /> </i>Speaking to <b>Rachel</b>, <i>&quot;Stay close to our effusive friend, and if we go away misteriously take your car and go home&quot;</i>\u200b<br /> <br /> While approaching <b>Gilad</b>:<br /> <br /> &quot;<i><b>Gilad</b>? </i><i>In the name of the San Francisco Consilium you are being detained for questioning pertaining your last mission.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <i>&quot;You have the right to remain silent. Anything you say can and will be used against you in a Consilium court. You have the right to talk to a lawyer for advice before we ask you any questions. You have the right to have a lawyer with you during questioning. If you cannot name a lawyer, one will be appointed for you before any questioning if you wish. If you decide to answer questions now without a lawyer present, you have the right to stop answering at any time.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Do you understand each of these rights? Having these rights in mind, do you wish to talk to us now?</i>\u200b&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> -----<br /> <br /> Here I expect Gilad's blank face since does not understand English, and no one has informed Amir of this. But as stated Olorin could be the answer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T11:55:55-07:00","id":1545002,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544994#post1544994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[5] No paradox</div> </div> </div> </div>So I'm waiting on description from Storyteller what <b>Gilad</b> heard from <b>Helmut</b>, in the end. There are 3 different factors now:<br /> <br /> 1. Helmut lost roll on talking (normaly) in Old Norse.<br /> 2. Helmut have turn on Mind Scan on understanding surface thoughts of Gilad.<br /> 3. There is hanging over Helmut small boon from Fae that he can suddenly speak Old Norse.<br /> <br /> I'm really interested how events outside of my character unfolds... \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-29-2024, 02:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T15:31:35-07:00","id":1545009,"title":"","content":"Olorion casts <i>Mental Scan </i>on Gilad<br /> It is a praxes<br /> <br /> Gnosis 2 + Mind 1 (Ruling) = 5 base<br /> +1 reach instant <br /> +1 reach sensory range<br /> +1 reach &quot;the mage is capable of reading through surface thoughts of the subject&quot; pg 159 MtAw <br /> <br /> Potency: 3 (-0 dice)<br /> Questions (one per potency): the general state of mind, the mage's most imperative desire, and the shape of the language he might speak<br /> <br /> Yantras: Dedicated/Path Tool: +1 (-2 paradox die)<br /> <br /> Dice pool: 6<br /> <br /> Withstand: Composure<br /> <br /> Roll: 9, 4, 3, 1, 1, 1<br /> Total Success: 1<br /> Paradox: None<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T16:08:01-07:00","id":1545010,"title":"","content":"His Composure is 2, so with a Potency of 3, you can ask one question.<br /> <br /> Since he just joined the main group and saw everyone there, his current surface thoughts (so they can be posted IC) are: <i>&quot;Galahad was not killed when time shifted ? That is a relief. Next I need to confirm for Trish, I must get the evidence to the Consilium.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T16:10:13-07:00","id":1545011,"title":"","content":"Would I recognize the language he is thinking in?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T16:27:39-07:00","id":1545012,"title":"","content":"Your sight shifts to a lodge made of carved wood. The sounds of songs, drink and stories echo throughout the halls, keeping winter's bite at bay. Your sight shifts once more, this time to a town with Swedish style architecture, to an instructor walking you through different adjustments in stance amidst different combat scenarios.<br /> <br /> [Gilad knows both Old Norse / Proto-Norse and modern Swedish]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T17:08:21-07:00","id":1545015,"title":"","content":"I just noticed we made a mistake, we reacted to Amir's statement as if it was said IC. We should probably edit it in, so the flow of the conversation is preserved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T17:18:56-07:00","id":1545016,"title":"","content":"Thanks for reminding me. I keep saying Old Norse, because that is easy. Technically Old Norse was a new language when Gilad lived in the 8th Century. The King's court where Gilad grew up probably still used proto-Norse as the official language, the same way that the Normans kept using French when they ruled over England later in the middle ages.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T17:23:10-07:00","id":1545017,"title":"","content":"I know this is probably meaningless to anyone else, but Teri Garr died today. She was in an episode of Star Trek, &quot;Asignment:Earth&quot; where she played a time traveler.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T17:24:32-07:00","id":1545019,"title":"","content":"I just checked as well, since the alphabet is called Fu\u00feark, I wondered if that was the name of the language as well and it seems its called Proto-Norse. However, some of Gilad's expressions are Finnish. His mother was Finnish and, while he didn't learn the language, she did teach him a lot of the slang and told him the myths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T17:40:12-07:00","id":1545022,"title":"","content":"Womp. No worries. I think all the language knowledge is really cool. I don't mind the attempt failing because I used the wrong language","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T19:34:44-07:00","id":1545029,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a><br /> <br /> Sorry for the delay. To resolve the mind scan that Helmut cast, I will say that Helmut was able to perceive the same surface thoughts as Olorian.<br /> <br /> Hearing the name &quot;Trish&quot; reminds Helmut of why he was there in the first place. The disappearing flower shop! Trish is the name of the younger sister of Nadeshiko, the woman who owns the flower shop.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 10-29-2024, 10:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T20:54:14-07:00","id":1545036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1545029#post1545029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hearing the name &quot;Trish&quot; reminds Helmut of why he was there in the first place. The disappearing flower shop! Trish is the name of the younger sister of Nadeshiko, the woman who owns the flower shop.</div> </div> </div> </div>Plot thickens! \u2764\ufe0f<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> <b>Can I ask for general scene overview, where everyone are in context to others and each one surrounding? </b>Best would be simple map, but on forum I understand we do not have luxury like that. <br /> <br /> Truth be told I'm a bit list where everyone are right now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-30-2024, 12:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T22:06:29-07:00","id":1545038,"title":"","content":"Do you mean where are the PCs and NPCs physically located in space, or where everyone is in terms of <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/StringTheory\" target=\"_blank\">solving the mystery/investigation?</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T22:34:07-07:00","id":1545039,"title":"","content":"Mostly first - locations on airport scene map. ( Maybe use some online whiteboard tool? ) But if you got notes on main Mystery - it would also be helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T23:23:18-07:00","id":1545040,"title":"","content":"In my imagination the location of the characters is pretty straightforward. Everyone is standing in a group a few meters from each other. Amir asked Rachel to stand next to Helmut, which is sort of funny looking to me, because Helmut is 1.97 m. and Rachel is 1.53 m. <br /> <br /> The exit to the airport is nearby. I assume, though I don't think it was made explicit, that Rachel and Helmut parked their vehicles somewhere - very expensive! <br /> <br /> Late at night, it is only about a 20 minute drive to Chinatown where the Better Luck Tomorrow Restaurant is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T23:28:34-07:00","id":1545041,"title":"","content":"As to &quot;What is going on?&quot; Well that is what you as PCs are trying to figure out. Like I said in the PM, everyone (including Galahad and Rachel) has at least one clue that can help put the puzzle together.<br /> <br /> Before we go into the next chapter, how about everyone state the clues they have and their own theory of what is going on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-30T15:33:35-07:00","id":1545072,"title":"","content":"Olorion has a book of Old Norse that is imprinted with kanji and the stylized image of a 6 tailed fox. The inside of the book indicates it is from Kitsune Books in Tokyo. <br /> My theory: Something is drawing this group to Kitsune Books, it may require the group to take a trip to Japan","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-30T15:46:24-07:00","id":1545073,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a><br /> Olorion also has a strong idea that there was something he was supposed to remember, and the only way to remember it is to explore his own Oneiros in astral form.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-30T15:49:15-07:00","id":1545075,"title":"","content":"Since the order of the previous post is all wibbly wobbly, just wanted to confirm that Amir has stated Gilad his rights and, since I imagine Olorion was in earshot, he probably overheard that Gilad has no clue to what he said.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-31T16:29:47-07:00","id":1545109,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> I can not find the rules about changing Aspirations. I want to modify one of Amir's aspirations to &quot;Prove Gilad innocence&quot; or &quot;Undo the plot effects&quot;<br /> <br /> Please advise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-31T17:12:26-07:00","id":1545110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1545041#post1545041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As to &quot;What is going on?&quot; Well that is what you as PCs are trying to figure out. Like I said in the PM, everyone (including Galahad and Rachel) has at least one clue that can help put the puzzle together.<br /> <br /> Before we go into the next chapter, how about everyone state the clues they have and their own theory of what is going on.</div> </div> </div> </div>Typically, the ST allows players to change their aspirations at the transition between chapters in a story. In my thinking one's aspirations determine a character's motivations and goals. That's why they are linked to earning XP for character advancement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-31T17:33:15-07:00","id":1545111,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1545110#post1545110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Typically, the ST allows players to change their aspirations at the transition between chapters in a story. In my thinking one's aspirations determine a character's motivations and goals. That's why they are linked to earning XP for character advancement.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks.<br /> <br /> I have a funny doubt, Amir has a near permanent <b>Constant Presence</b> on him, does any one like him keep seeing changes in the world every time they win a Clash of Wills when someone in the world uses <b>Shifting Sands</b> or similar effects? It would be weird.<br /> <br /> My <i>hypothesis </i>is that this is a Demon Crossover, Pacts retroactive changes to the world would make many things possible plus something like what Seattle has but a different scale.<br /> <br /> The fact that Gilad friends spoke all the languages of the world made it look this way for me (it could be a<i> Universal Language</i> spell too, sure).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-31T18:08:50-07:00","id":1545112,"title":"","content":"To clarify, Gilad's cabal spoke modern Swedish, because they were all from Scandinavia.<br /> <br /> Trish Takehashi would usually know a stranges's language by lucky chance. She did go to <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/EliteSchoolMeansEliteBrain\" target=\"_blank\">Todai AND Oxford</a> after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-31T18:18:26-07:00","id":1545114,"title":"","content":"Speaking of Aspirations, I could only take a look at revising Gilad's as well. Sorry it took a bit, these is what I came up with, please let me know what you think. One for short term, one for mid term and one for long term:<br /> <br /> Prove my innocence<br /> Find out what happened to Trish and the other members of Utopia.<br /> Become a better Talon.<br /> <br /> Since its the second time Gilad has people be affected by timey wimey stuff while he was nearby, its clear that his current training was still not enough to protect those around him.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-31T19:07:58-07:00","id":1545118,"title":"","content":"Speaking of being a better Talon. Gilad would probably remember that Galahad's mentor was Trish's brother in law Caliburn , the Brotherhood of Demon Wind mage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-01T07:18:40-07:00","id":1545133,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1545111#post1545111\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thanks.<br /> <br /> I have a funny doubt, Amir has a near permanent <b>Constant Presence</b> on him, does any one like him keep seeing changes in the world every time they win a Clash of Wills when someone in the world uses <b>Shifting Sands</b> or similar effects? It would be weird.<br /> <br /> My <i>hypothesis </i>is that this is a Demon Crossover, Pacts retroactive changes to the world would make many things possible plus something like what Seattle has but a different scale.<br /> <br /> The fact that Gilad friends spoke all the languages of the world made it look this way for me (it could be a<i> Universal Language</i> spell too, sure).</div> </div> </div> </div>A demon Pact is a solid guess, I wonder what was traded away. An Abyssal pact is another possibility, since there were Scelestus around, maybe a Seer struck a deal with their patron.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-01T22:06:45-07:00","id":1545195,"title":"","content":"So it's clear that Helmut will want to remake his Aspirations in coming weeks from his all confession to Amir. It also will probably be list of present subplots in game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543784-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e-chronicle-ic?p=1545194#post1545194\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>Helmut</b> looks around when majority of team disappeared from scene, evidently waiting to answer <b>Amir</b> when room will be much more emptier:<br /> <i>'Amir, my man. I will not leave this as it is. I literally stumble about this Time Mystery of Disappearing Flower Shop on my own. Your 'guest' is time displaced Viking, confused hundred times more than me when I first show up in 2022. And he was harassed by actors that I can only describe as Followers of the Lie. My Libertine heart is boiling. Man, Fates are pointing me to take up this case.'</i> -<br /> <br /> He makes a bit breather, mulling over what he should talk about to <b>Amir</b>, looking deep in to his eyes.<br /> <i>'I'm guy who came from the past to show you all better future. As a Man of Hour, you should know I need to fix things. And some old man's Concilium be damn if they get in my way of making world better - even for this poor Viking and this petit girl you have here. No, some 'old man club', dressed in funny robes, judging others by ancient laws - will not stop me. Not too mention i feel that Mysteries literally pointed me to you all, guys.'</i><br /> <br /> Breaths with a deep sight, but continues:<br /> <i>'I know we have... management issues, you and me, Amir. But even if you will not take me to your working CABAL, coven, circle or whatever you will call this...' </i>- <b>Helmut</b> hands dramatically on all the other mages in the room. - '<i>I still will be following this case. Norns are pointing me to do this. I was even called as 'farseer of Heimdall'.' </i>- Big hippie chuckle for second.<br /> <br /> <b>Helmut</b>'s face is stone serious. His eyes are deep as his hugging arms - and his soul:<br /> <i>'I NEED to do this. And I know, deep inside this a bit twisted mind, you also want to help those people, Amir. Knowing you, I think you already planing their defense against Consillium. Let me help and let both of us do good for all the people.'</i></div> </div> </div> </div>The working version is something like this - but it will be hammered in coming days, depending on Amir's and others reactions to his confession:<br /> <br /> <b>Short-Term</b><br /> Help Gilad learn modern English<br /> Learn Old Norse / modern Swedish<br /> <br /> <b>Long-Term</b><br /> Help defend Gilad against Concilium<br /> Find the Followers of Lie that harassed the Gilad<br /> <br /> <b>Obsessions</b><br /> Understand the weird 'two plot lines' around Gilad<br /> Understand disappearing of Flower Shop<br /> <br /> <b>Bonus </b>( Not mechanical )<br /> Learn more about Heimdall to impress Gilad as 'farseerer' \ud83d\ude01<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> <b>Which of those languages will be easier for Helmut to learn - Old Norse or modern Swedish?</b> To help communicate with Gilad inside team, without magic?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-02T16:51:37-07:00","id":1545232,"title":"","content":"Modern Swedish probably has the advantage of having the most modern speakers. However, learning Proto-Norse means that, if you do end up meeting Heimdall, you will have an easier time speaking to him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-02T17:25:31-07:00","id":1545236,"title":"","content":"Correct. IC, Modern Swedish would be easier to learn. But Gilad is currently less fluent. OOC I'm not sure that it matters. It would be a merit dot either way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-02T17:32:54-07:00","id":1545237,"title":"","content":"Just a reminder, in MtAw 2E Mage obsessions are not the same thing as mortal sleeper obsessions. A mage is obsessed with a magical mystery. The same way a Uratha has a particular hunt they must go on. It's why you earn arcane beats instead of regular beats, and loose Wisdom if you pursue your obsession overzealously.<br /> <br /> The initial plot hook for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> 's &quot;In the Hallow Light&quot; is a good example of an obsession gone too far.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 11-02-2024, 08:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-02T17:39:15-07:00","id":1545238,"title":"","content":"Since <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> is interested in such things, it should be noted that Archmages also have obsessions. It's just that they have the ability to recreate whole worlds to follow their obsessions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-02T23:18:12-07:00","id":1545240,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1545236#post1545236\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Correct. IC, Modern Swedish would be easier to learn. But Gilad is currently less fluent. OOC I'm not sure that it matters. It would be a merit dot either way.</div> </div> </div> </div>If the gameplay difficulty is the same - I will then go with Old Norse to follow. It has much bigger sense in character concepts. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-04T08:47:39-08:00","id":1545311,"title":"","content":"Week 5<br /> <br /> We are so close to the end of chapter 1 &quot;Manifest Destiny&quot; (Should I PUN-ish you all for not incorporating the name of the chapter into game play? Nah, it's cool). We just need to get everyone to that restaurant in Chinatown. Hopefully with some sort of evidence or defense for Gilad to present to the high council.<br /> <br /> If I'm understanding you all correctly, the answer to my IMPORTANT ST question &quot;What do you currently think is going on, and what clues are you going to follow to solve this mystery/investigation?&quot;<br /> <br /> The Big Idea: to differing degrees, everyone in the party except Amir has experienced some sort of time anomaly. The most immediate result of this time anomaly is that Gilad is being accused by members of his order and the concillium in Buenos Aires of betraying his cabal to their deaths and handing over a large quantity of tass (enough to power a significant spell that would have a global impact) to the Seers. This is different from Gilad's memory, which is that he and his cabal, with the help of his sleepwalker friend Trish Takahashi, were able to recover the tass for the use of the Adamantine Arrow.<br /> <br /> Significant clues<ul><li>Gilad remembers Trish and Galahad being on the flight with him to San Francisco. But then they disappeared at <b>a certain point in time</b> during the flight. He was unable to find any luggage belonging to them. And the only evidence that Trish was on the flight is that he has her mobile phone. Whenever he mentions Trish's name, no one seems to know who he is talking about, even if it would make sense for them to remember her (mechanically Trish has Fame 2 in this setting. She is a well known newspaper journalist. Like Lois Lane in Metropolis, or Vicky Vale in Gotham).</li> <li>Helmut was in his favorite flower shop, which is owned by Trish's older sister, Nadeshiko, who lives on a near by flower farm with her husband, the Ronin Talon Caliburn, and their two daughters. At <b>a certain point in time</b> the flower shop disappeared, and in its place was a new store under construction, Kitsune Books. When Helmut asked sleepers in the area, none of them could recall a flower shop ever being there. Like it never existed. He looked in his phone contacts, and could not find Caliburn's phone number. That's when he called Amir, his very nice lawyer friend.</li> <li>Gilad notices that Galahad, who in his memory was part of the Nazi gold/Tass quest because Caliburn sent him to protect Trish, seems like a different person. Instead of a sword wielding, abyss fighting, bad a**, he looks like a bookish academic who might get lost in his own museum.</li> <li>Olorian has a vague sense that he is supposed to remember something. But the only way to remember it is going into his own Oneiros.</li> <li>Amir knows that several members of his cryptopoly have gone missing recently. Could the missing cult members be connected to Helmut's missing flower shop, and Gilad's missing friend?</li> </ul><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-04T08:51:45-08:00","id":1545313,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a> Thinks that it all has something to do with the book Olorion found that was purchased at Kitsune Books in Tokyo. Might require a trip to Japan to investigate more.<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> Thinks that it has something to do with the g'd-machine and the unchained, similar to how things work in Seattle (OOC. It is unclear how much Amir knows about the unchained IC)<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> Thinks that Helmut feels a special kinship with Gilad because they both experienced time travel as part of their awakenings, and that Helmut will do anything to get to the bottom of this mystery.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-04T10:02:50-08:00","id":1545322,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1545313#post1545313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a> Thinks that it all has something to do with the book Olorion found that was purchased at Kitsune Books in Tokyo. Might require a trip to Japan to investigate more.<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> Thinks that it has something to do with the g'd-machine and the unchained, similar to how things work in Seattle (OOC. It is unclear how much Amir knows about the unchained IC)<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> Thinks that Helmut feels a special kinship with Gilad because they both experienced time travel as part of their awakenings, and that Helmut will do anything to get to the bottom of this mystery.</div> </div> </div> </div>Amir knows nothing IC.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-05T14:32:37-08:00","id":1545414,"title":"","content":"Amir uses his attainments to ask:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>If I inform the Archdeacon first, will I have better chances to succeed than if I wait after delivery to inform?</li> <li>Will <b>Gilad </b>be offered a fair chance to prove his innocence?</li> <li>Will I regret no doing anything else before going into the restaurant?</li> </ol><br /> And then the next questions:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Will <b>Galahad </b>be useful for proving <b>Gilad</b>'s innocence? (Amir expects a no)</li> <li>Will <b>Olorin </b>be useful for proving <b>Gilad</b>'s innocence? (Amir is unsure)</li> <li>Will <b>Helmut </b>be useful for proving <b>Gilad</b>'s innocence? (Amir expects a yes)</li> </ol><br /> I dont want to drag the thread, but Divination as an attainment makes Amir a cautious man.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-05T18:04:39-08:00","id":1545420,"title":"","content":"I have no problem with it. I find both the meticulously planning Acanthus and the spontaneous one to be a lot of fun, and thankfully we have both. It also means we can both be more tactical and have a specialist for when some unexpected shenanigans happens. I think that works out great.<br /> <br /> On a small side note, since Gilad is not sure if everyone would be ok with him casting, he will hold off on using <i>Mutable Mask</i> suggestion unless he gets confirmation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 11-05-2024, 09:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-05T21:21:57-08:00","id":1545434,"title":"","content":"I also enjoy having a variety of Acanthoi in the game. And no problems with using divination (as it is described in the book <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />).<br /> <br /> I'm going to go ahead and interpret the first question as &quot;If I ask the Archdeacon for help before I go to the restaurant, will he help me.&quot; If you intended something else, let me know. Divination is a Time Spell; it cannot tell you the chances of anything. The future is 100% certain from Time's perspective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-05T21:28:47-08:00","id":1545435,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> 2. Yes<br /> 3. Yes (though it is difficult for the ST to determine how a PC will feel about events in the game)<br /> <br /> Second casting<br /> 1. Yes<br /> 2. Yes<br /> 3. Yes","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-05T21:31:20-08:00","id":1545437,"title":"","content":"As a reminder, it is 9 PM game time. The instructions were to deliver Gilad by midnight. It takes 20 to 30 minutes to get to the restaurant from the airport. So you have a little bit of wiggle room if you need to do something before you face the high council.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-05T23:27:59-08:00","id":1545442,"title":"","content":"True story<br /> <br /> I once had a PC cast divination (with the reach), but he only had two questions, so for his third question he randomly asked, &quot;how will this other PC die?&quot;<br /> <br /> so I...ahem...made something up on the spot.<br /> <br /> and the party spent the rest of the chronicle trying to avoid the death I had described rather than following the story I had planned. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-05T23:47:49-08:00","id":1545445,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544395#post1544395\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Politics check 7 successes<br /> <br /> Wu Tao is the hierarch of the Concillium of San Francisco. He is probably around one hundred years old and came to power in the 70s amidst revialries between factions that mirrored sleeper gang wars of the period. He tends to prefer diplomatic and peaceful solutions to problems without duels, torture, and assassination.<br /> <br /> Colt, Wu Tao's provost, is allied with the Bay City Marshal faction of the Free Council, and as his shadow name implies tends to think that peace is made with an application of force. It may be that he is not that interested in seeing Gilad put on trial or taken in unharmed...or alive.<br /> <br /> The Talon Sentinal and the Interfector would probably like to see the Silver Ladder and the Libertines embarrassed by the incident in Argentina. Sending Galahad, the &quot;bookish&quot; Talon from Berkeley to help arrest Gilad, an apparently dangerous warrior, may be a reflection of those interests.<br /> <br /> Tai Sui, the Archdeacon, is an old friend of Wu Tao. Who knows how old? Anyways, he may be playing some other game entirely. But it is hard to know what the ancient Kingmaker is planning. The one thing you are sure of his that he is <i>very</i> fond of his great grand daughter.<br /> <br /> Take the informed condition for your exceptional success.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Helpful reminder. I know it was a while back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-05T23:55:30-08:00","id":1545446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1517873-songs-for-the-dead-mtaw2e-ic?p=1523318#post1523318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The frail looking old woman tried to straighten herself to her full height, which was still small, only about 1.52 m.. She smiled and replied in Swedish with a thick accent of some kind. To Gilad's ears it sounded a little like the men of the south, the Goths.<br /> &quot;Welcome my young friend. Or should I say old? Tell me, do you know the game of chess? I have been playing a most interesting game recently and I am in need of advise on my next move.&quot;<br /> <br /> A laughing gleam was in her clear, unclouded, blue eyes.</div> </div> </div> </div>OOC This is not the first time Gilad will have met someone from the Awakening Gambit legacy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-06T00:18:33-08:00","id":1545448,"title":"","content":"2nd helpful reminder.<br /> <br /> The Bay City Marshals were a nameless order unique to San Francisco that were absorbed into the Free Council around the turn of the 20th century, after the earthquake. They are part Mage order, part Changeling court and serve the spirit of Justice (a very Arcadian flavored version of Justice. Think Grimm' original fairytale endings)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> as a libertine Acanthus Helmut is probably aware that the four Changeling courts are Justice (Fall) Temperance (Winter) Clemency (Spring) and Cherity (Summer).<br /> <br /> In game it is currently Fall, thus the early sunset.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-07T11:48:08-08:00","id":1545527,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1545448#post1545448\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2nd helpful reminder.<br /> <br /> The Bay City Marshals were a nameless order unique to San Francisco that were absorbed into the Free Council around the turn of the 20th century, after the earthquake. They are part Mage order, part Changeling court and serve the spirit of Justice (a very Arcadian flavored version of Justice. Think Grimm' original fairytale endings)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> as a libertine Acanthus Helmut is probably aware that the four Changeling courts are Justice (Fall) Temperance (Winter) Clemency (Spring) and Cherity (Summer).<br /> <br /> In game it is currently Fall, thus the early sunset.</div> </div> </div> </div>I assume that we are all enroute now?<br /> <br /> Or is something missing yet? I will edit my last IC post with the divination results.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-07T12:55:20-08:00","id":1545530,"title":"","content":"That was my assumption. That Helmut is getting Un1corn, and everyone else is piled into the car. Is Rachel driving, or someone else?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-07T15:39:57-08:00","id":1545536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-