('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> gets an arcane beat for reducing the opacity of the mystery of the time distortion.<br /> <br /> Everyone is en route to high council meeting at the Better Luck Tomorrow Restaurant. Amir cast divination to try to figure out what is in store for the future. The Archdeacon of the Silver Ladder caucus is busy dealing with disappearing cultists. Helmut is trying to get to know Galahad better while cruising on his motorcycle. And Gilad had an epiphany that Trish's phone may be an uchronic artifact that may hold important clues for the mystery that has enveloped the party.<br /> <br /> What will happen next!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-12T17:10:59-08:00","id":1545757,"title":"","content":"Cool, since I just reached 5 beats, I will invest it so Gilad finishes learning <i>Language:English</i> in his downtime. Once we get to safety, the info on the Mystery will be divulged.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-14T17:55:17-08:00","id":1545898,"title":"","content":"Alright. Chapter 2. Let's go!<br /> <br /> Would anyone like to do anything before the party enters the private back room of the restaurant?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-14T18:46:05-08:00","id":1545901,"title":"","content":"I'm declaring official Aspirations and Obsession for Helmut on this chapter:<br /> <br /> <b>Short-Term</b> Help Gilad learn modern English<br /> Learn Old Norse<br /> <br /> <b>Long-Term</b><br /> Help defend Gilad against Concilium<br /> Find the Followers of Lie that harassed the Gilad<br /> <br /> <b>Obsessions</b><br /> Understand the weird 'two plot lines' around Gilad<br /> Understand disappearing of Flower Shop<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-19T21:27:12-08:00","id":1546178,"title":"","content":"Week 7<br /> <br /> Not a lot of activity. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> used 5 beats to purchase a Language merit dot for English. I'll be interested to see how you all work that in IC.<br /> <br /> Amir has learned that the Archdeacon of the Silver Ladder Caucus is dealing with some sort of emergency related to his mystery cult, the Hypnopompic Circle.This brings to his mind painful memories of about a year ago when one of the leaders of his cult, Laura, and several other cultists disappeared, and the Guardians of the Veil had to intervene to avoid a breach of the veil.<br /> <br /> Helmut had a conversation with Galahad about whether God exists. From Helmut's perspective it is very unusual for a recently awakened Obrimos to be so skeptical about the Supreme Being. He thought they were all &quot;<a href=\"https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dr-clef-s-proposal\" target=\"_blank\">Preparing</a>&quot; for Armegedon.<br /> <br /> Everyone is now at the restaurant about to go in to meet with the high council and see what fate awaits Gilad. I assume, based on the lack of activity, that everyone wants to just go in and see what happens without discussing a plan or casting any spells. <br /> <br /> Good luck!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-20T06:21:49-08:00","id":1546190,"title":"","content":"Gad didn't know he was going directly to court, Amir said they would come here to discuss.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-20T06:53:50-08:00","id":1546193,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1546190#post1546190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Gad didn't know he was going directly to court, Amir said they would come here to discuss.</div> </div> </div> </div>Amir expects just discussion, but since this is a plot, most likely someone will rush things and make it an impromptu judgement. I will edit my post in the other thread to make that clearer.<br /> <br /> While staying within the bounds of the law as detailed, this is the (current) best path.<br /> <br /> Essentially, just delivering Gilad, finishes the Consilium request of &quot;Bring me this man&quot;, so Amir plans to immediately go to &quot;Now that I brought him here, <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/got-champion-i-will-be-your-champion-got-game-of-thrones-your-champion-gif-13903391\" target=\"_blank\">I want to be his defense</a>&quot;<br /> <br /> Amir has promised himself to aid Gilad, as an Acanthus this has weight, we got you fam.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-20T07:16:26-08:00","id":1546194,"title":"","content":"Yep, but I think some of that was lost in translation. So when presented with that, Gilad's priority was to make sure that at least he can make a strong enough case that this is investigated. <br /> <br /> Maybe I should re-edit that, if they all knew this was a needed step, then he wouldn't have such a strong reaction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-20T12:19:31-08:00","id":1546203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1546194#post1546194\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yep, but I think some of that was lost in translation. So when presented with that, Gilad's priority was to make sure that at least he can make a strong enough case that this is investigated.<br /> <br /> Maybe I should re-edit that, if they all knew this was a needed step, then he wouldn't have such a strong reaction.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that it is good as it is, it shows that it is hard to plan with and about him with the language barrier, in Ascension or 1ed Awakening this would be how to roleplay a Flaw.<br /> <br /> And it is clear that a Consilium is not what we would call a paragon of rights in our current society, the Consilium is not a government as we conceive it, it is more of a set guardrails so nominally allied mages do not step into each other toes (due how Obsession works) and end up killing each other.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Seers solved the same problem with a different model: &quot;people on top can shit on people below&quot; with the Exarchs being on the very top of the pyramid, you can get away with much but woe if you oppose something that comes from really above.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-20T14:56:39-08:00","id":1546213,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1544417#post1544417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> He will probably send a message to Galahad to arrange for safe passage to present the evidence he has.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sorry if there was confusion OOC about what was going on. I reread the thread (all 17 pages!). Part of the confusion may have stemed from the initial assignment for Amir having been given behind a spoiler tag, because I thought it would be fun to play with the shock of Gilad finding out that time had &quot;glitched&quot; on him. <br /> <br /> The plan, from Amir's perspective (he is the only character that did not experience some kind of glitch, and therefore can be assumed to be fully part of the currently dominant timeline) was to take Gilad into custody and bring him before the council. Colt, the hierarch's provost, seemed initially reluctant to provide Amir with information on where to take Gilad after he caught him at the airport, but did so after Amir insisted.<br /> <br /> While I never said this explicitly ( though it was somewhat implied by Time's answers to Amir's divination castings) I think the assumption was that the council would render some sort of verdict on what to do with Gilad once Amir and Galahad handed him over<br /> <br /> This is why I feel like I've been kind of pushing you all to come up with &quot;evidence&quot; for Gilad's innocence. Because otherwise the council is most likely to side with the story the Buenos Aires concillium is currently telling. In that case the best case scenario is that Gilad is challenged to a dual rather than summarily executed, because at least then the &quot;eternal warrior&quot; would have a chance to fight back.<br /> <br /> Again, I'm sorry if I didn't adequately explain what the <a href=\"https://memes.getyarn.io/yarn-clip/112199d7-1a2b-442d-908c-d2a8dba49e1c/gif\" target=\"_blank\">stakes</a> were for this meeting with the council.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-20T15:11:15-08:00","id":1546215,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> is correct that the Concillium is not primarily concerned with justice as sleepers concive of it ( especially the bit about &quot;presumed innocent until proven guilty&quot;) From the perspective of the Lex Magica Gilad is being accused of violating the <b>Precept of Hubris</b>, by attacking his cabal mates and stealing from his order. So his best defense would be either to prove that Gilad didn't betray Utopia to the Seers, or provide &quot;a good reason&quot; for why he did so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-20T15:19:00-08:00","id":1546216,"title":"","content":"The one thing wizards for sure hate is when you steal their stuff. I suppose if Gilad could somehow guarantee the return of the stolen hoard of Tass that the Adamantine Arrow might be willing to overlook the deaths of Utopia.<br /> <br /> The Fae influenced Bay City Marshals might have other ideas though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-28T17:38:57-08:00","id":1546478,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> OK. Why don't you use Coax Spirits to open Trishs phone again. Do you want to use Gilad's new English skill or do you want have the Spirts of the phone to read to you?<br /> <br /> Does someone with Time want to use focused mage sight and Postcognition to do some investigating?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-29T08:39:12-08:00","id":1546483,"title":"","content":"I was hoping someone else would have an easier time interacting with the phone, especially if they are good at investigation or computers. Right now Gilad is presenting what he knows based on Galahad's comments. Since Gilad has an Eidetic Memory, I tried to present it as an ancient version of the mind palace technique, a useful way to recall a lot of oral tradition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-29T11:18:41-08:00","id":1546486,"title":"","content":"<a h