 <br /> Give me an Int + Socialize with +2 ( for your True Friend Merit)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-29T11:29:52-08:00","id":1546488,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543247-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e?p=1546478#post1546478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> OK. Why don't you use Coax Spirits to open Trishs phone again. Do you want to use Gilad's new English skill or do you want have the Spirts of the phone to read to you?<br /> <br /> Does someone with Time want to use focused mage sight and Postcognition to do some investigating?</div> </div> </div> </div>I want to do a sequencial casting: Exceptional Luck on Amir, Postcognition, another Exceptional Luck, and then the Focused Mage Sight, but after hearing all relevant clues.<br /> <br /> Today I am a bit busy but putting the outlines of my plan OC to hear feedback.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-29T11:30:04-08:00","id":1546489,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a><br /> Did you want to roll an Int + Computer with your Database Research skill specialty?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-29T14:41:22-08:00","id":1546491,"title":"","content":"Roger that<br /> <br /> Int (2) + Untrained Socialize (-1) + True Friend (2) = 3 dice<br /> <br /> 6, 5, 3 = 0 successes<br /> <br /> The plan sounds good. I think we could also ask Galahad to add some Prime as well, such as <i>As Above, So Below</i> , <i>Nimbus Tuning </i>and <i>Light Under A Bushel</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 11-29-2024, 05:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-29T16:26:53-08:00","id":1546493,"title":"","content":"In case <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a> chooses to do the database research, would it be possible to also aid him with an inversed version of <i>Gremlins</i> ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-29T18:34:29-08:00","id":1546495,"title":"","content":"Ok well despite feeling a close connection to Trish, Gilad is unable to recall any personal details of Trish's life that could help with the internet searches. I guess they didn't talk much. Maybe it was the language barrier.<br /> <br /> Galahad is of course willing to help. OOC my preference is for NPC to take the back seat, but I understand if sometimes the party needs a boost.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-30T07:27:50-08:00","id":1546501,"title":"","content":"Gilad is slowly learning the social norms of the modern world, but he is working so that less details are lost in translation.<br /> <br /> One question though, do High Speech statements count as further evidence? It cannot be used to lie or convey nuance, would most Consilia accept them as one more element in his favor?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-03T21:31:36-08:00","id":1546576,"title":"","content":"At the very least it could prove that Gilad thinks that he is telling the truth. I'm not sure that High Speech makes all statements true in an absolute sense.<br /> <br /> Perhaps in more &quot;progressive&quot; concillia High Speech is forbidden for reasons similar to the 5th amendment in U.S legal system - you cannot be forced to incriminate oneself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-08T13:23:20-08:00","id":1546770,"title":"","content":"Okay, Amir is casting now.<br /> <br /> I am assuming the scene has changed so Paradox die is reset.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Exceptional Luck (rote):</i><br /> +1 Reach assigned to instant use, +2 Reach: The boon or hex can affect spellcasting rolls, +1 Reach to make the boon a 8-Again<br /> <br /> Gnosis (3) + Fate (3) + Shadow Name (3) + High Speech (2) + Willpower (3) = 14 dice (with 9-again)<br /> <br /> 5, <b>10</b>, <b>9</b>, <b>8</b>, 7, <b>10</b>, 6, 2, <b>9</b>, 5, 2, 3, 5, 3, 5, <b>8</b>, 1, 5 = 6 successes (Exceptional success).<br /> <br /> <br /> -Shadow Name I am AMIR, a prince among men, I am empowering myself.<br /> -Subject is myself.<br /> -Boon is 8-again on spellcasting rolls, lasts for 1 turn.\u200b<br /> -Amir recovers the spent Willpower point.<br /> <br /> <br /> For the Exceptional Success, I recover a Willpower point (currently -1 on my total), and pick the +1 Reach benefit to Move the spell from Standard to Advanced Duration.<br /> <br /> For the spell results, I get 3 potence, so 3 rolls to use the 8-again.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Postcognition</i>:<br /> +1 Reach assigned to instant use\u200b, +1 Reach to \u201cscrub\u201d the vision like a video, +1 Reach to Move the spell from Standard to Advanced Duration.<br /> <br /> Gnosis (3) + Time (3) + High Speech (2) + Willpower (3) = 11 dice (with 8-again)<br /> <br /> 5, 5, 4, <b>10</b>, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 4, 7, 6 = 1 success.<br /> <br /> Amir spends one of the 3 rolls from the previous spell. I moved the spell from standard to Advanced Duration because I am not sure if I can use the &quot;scrub&quot; vision during a short time, so I can take as much time as I need with the Cellphone.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> If the temporal sympathy is withstood then please feel free to correct my numbers on the POSTCOGNITION dice.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}